{"meta":{"id":"tt0068646","type":"movie","name":"El Padrino","imdb_id":"tt0068646","description":"Don Vito Corleone es el respetado y temido jefe de una de las cinco familias de la mafia de Nueva York. Tiene cuatro hijos: una chica, Connie, y tres varones: el impulsivo Sonny, el pusilánime Freddie y Michael, que no quiere saber nada de los negocios de su padre. Cuando Corleone, siempre aconsejado por su consejero Tom Hagen, se niega a intervenir en el negocio de las drogas, el jefe de otra banda ordena su asesinato. Empieza entonces una violenta y cruenta guerra entre las familias mafiosas.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt0068646.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ejdD20cdHNFAYAN2DlqPToXKyzx.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hx3rXLrBSstfGJ9JSJNb5PNcYJw.png","genres":["Drama","Crimen"],"releaseInfo":"1972","released":"1972-03-14T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"175 min","imdbRating":"9.2","country":"United States of America","cast":["Marlon Brando","Al Pacino","James Caan","Robert Duvall","Richard S. Castellano","Diane Keaton","Talia Shire","Gianni Russo","Sterling Hayden","John Marley","Richard Conte","Al Lettieri","Abe Vigoda","John Cazale","Rudy Bond","Al Martino","Morgana King","Lenny Montana","John Martino","Salvatore Corsitto","Richard Bright","Alex Rocco","Tony Giorgio","Vito Scotti","Tere Livrano","Victor Rendina","Jeannie Linero","Julie Gregg","Ardell Sheridan","Simonetta Stefanelli"],"director":["Francis Ford Coppola"],"writer":["Mario Puzo","Francis Ford Coppola","Robert Towne"],"trailers":[{"source":"v72XprPxy3E","type":"Trailer","name":"El Padrino | Tráiler oficial | 50 aniversario | Paramount Pictures Spain","ytId":"v72XprPxy3E","lang":"es"},{"source":"Ew9ngL1GZvs","type":"Trailer","name":"50th Anniversary Trailer","ytId":"Ew9ngL1GZvs","lang":"en"},{"source":"8V2k2YQEQJ4","type":"Trailer","name":"Original Trailer","ytId":"8V2k2YQEQJ4","lang":"en"}],"trai